---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { u, telHref } from '../lib/paths';
import { firm, lawyer, office, peer, coOffice, serviceGroups } from '../content/site';
---

<Base
  title="服務範圍"
  description={`${firm.name}的服務範圍：${serviceGroups.map((g) => g.title).join('、')}。臺南市中西區府前路一段188號，初次諮詢不收費。`}
  current="services"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Practice Areas</p>
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">服務範圍</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__lede">
        以下依案件類型整理，每一項後面都附上一句白話說明——如果哪一句聽起來像您現在的處境，那大概就是您要找的類別。不確定的話，直接來電說明即可，初次諮詢不收費。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="groups">
        {serviceGroups.map((g) => (
          <article class="group">
            <div class="group__head">
              <h2>{g.title}</h2>
              <p class="group__body">{g.body}</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="items">
              {g.items.map((it) => (
                <li>
                  <span class="term">{it.term}</span>
                  <span class="plain">{it.plain}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper2">
    <div class="wrap co-office">
      <p class="eyebrow">Separate practices</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">{coOffice.title}</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p class="lede co-office__intro">{coOffice.intro}</p>
      <div class="co-office__roles">
        {coOffice.roles.map((role) => (
          <div class="co-office__role">
            <h3>{role.name}</h3>
            <p>{role.description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="lede co-office__note">{coOffice.note}</p>
      <p class="notice co-office__notice">{office.disclaimer}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper2">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Not listed?</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">沒有列到您的問題？</h2>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p class="lede">
        以上是{lawyer.name}律師主要承辦的類型，不是全部。法律問題常常一開始看起來像 A、談過才發現是 B——初次諮詢不收費，先講講看再說。
      </p>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">
        若您的問題屬於<strong>{peer.areas}</strong>，也可以直接聯繫
        <a href={peer.url}>{peer.firmName}</a>。
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href={telHref(lawyer.tel)}>致電 {lawyer.tel}</a>
        <a class="btn" href={u('/consult/')}>委任流程與常見問題</a>
      </div>
      <p class="notice" style="margin-top:2.6rem">
        本頁所列為服務範圍，非個案承諾。依律師業務推展規範，律師不得表示訴訟勝訴率，亦不得公開受任中或過去承辦的個案。個案能不能做、怎麼做，請以面談後的評估與委任契約為準。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .groups { display: grid; gap: 0; }
  .group {
    padding-block: 2.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    display: grid; gap: 1.6rem;
  }
  .group:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
  .group:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .group { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; gap: 3rem; } }

  .group h2 { font-size: 1.45rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .group__body { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0; }

  .items { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
  .items li {
    display: grid; gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }
  .items li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .items li { grid-template-columns: 9.5em 1fr; gap: 1rem; align-items: baseline; }
  }
  .term { font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .plain { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.75; }

  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }

  .co-office__intro { max-width: 48em; }
  .co-office__roles {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .co-office__roles { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.4rem; }
  }
  .co-office__role {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;
    background: rgba(156, 116, 64, 0.05);
  }
  .co-office__role h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
  .co-office__role p { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0; }
  .co-office__note { margin-top: 1.6rem; }
  .co-office__notice { margin-top: 1.6rem; }
</style>
